          "text": "Good evening, Padre!"
        },{
          "speakerId": "capitan_tiago",
          "text": "I have the honor of presenting to you Don Crisostomo Ibarra, the son of my deceased friend."
        },{
          "speakerId": "capitan_tiago",
          "text": "The young gentleman has just arrived from Europe and I went to meet him."
